  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients). Grate carrot. Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a large saucepan, melt the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook onion, carrot and chickpeas until tender, 3-4 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f869e2cade9b9f0aced327/step-37f37700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium-high, add garlic, masala spice blend and curry spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in basmati rice and the water, then bring to the boil.\n• Cover and reduce heat to medium-low. Cook for 12 mins, then remove pan from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 15 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f869e2cade9b9f0aced327/step-3c6ea010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once rice has finished cooking, add baby spinach, then stir until wilted and combined. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f869e2cade9b9f0aced327/step-828def20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide chickpea and veggie biryani between bowls.\n• Top with Greek-style yoghurt. Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f869e2cade9b9f0aced327/step-c7cec230.jpg"
    }
  ]
